---
// Founder credibility section
---

<section id="founder" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-[var(--bg-secondary)]">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Photo -->
      <div class="shrink-0">
        <div class="w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--bg-tertiary)] border border-[var(--border)] overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/founder.jpg"
            alt="Sergey Kovalev"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bio -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold">Built by Sergey Kovalev</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] font-mono text-sm mt-1 mb-4">
          CTO &middot; 15+ years shipping production systems
        </p>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          I built Mission Control because I was tired of the busywork. Switching between worktrees,
          rerunning the same pipeline steps, babysitting agents that crash halfway through a task.
          I'm an architect — I want to design systems, not manage processes.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mt-3">
          MC automates everything between "here's the task" and "here's the PR." The governance
          and audit trails came from my years as CTO of a regulated crypto exchange — but honestly,
          even if you don't need compliance, you'll want them. Knowing exactly what your AI did
          and why is just good engineering.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4 mt-6">
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/skovalev" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
            class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)] transition-colors">
            LinkedIn &nearr;
          </a>
          <a href="https://twitter.com/sergeyk0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
            class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)] transition-colors">
            Twitter &nearr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
